00:15:52.640 --> 00:16:00.200
We'll go back to the fish and we'll bring the fish into our project,
我们回到鱼的造型那里，把鱼添加到我们的项目中，

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:03.768
and I would like for the fish to do something when I press a key.
我希望当我按下某个键时，这条鱼能做点什么。

00:16:03.768 --> 00:16:06.560
So let's start simple-- let's first figure out what Event do I need
那我们从简单的开始——首先我们要弄清楚我需要使用哪种事件

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.670
to use--
去使用——

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:12.020
and well we have this block here that is When Space Key Pressed.
这里有个积木是“当按下空格键时”。

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:15.440
Which I guess would mean that, when I press the space bar on my keyboard,
我猜这意味着，当我按下键盘上的空格键时，

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:17.210
something's going to happen.
会有事情发生。

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:18.540
What do I want to have happen?
我希望发生什么事情呢？

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:25.440
Well, let's go into sound, and let's Play the Sound Bubbles Until Done.
嗯，我们来看看声音板块，然后“播放声音‘泡泡声’直到播放完毕”。

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:28.535
And so now, I'll go ahead and press the Space key--
现在，我来按下空格键——

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:36.090
and when I press Space key, you hear the bubbles-- and every time
当我按下空格键时，你能听到泡泡声——而且每次

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:38.100
I press this Space key, that's a different Event
我按下空格键，这都是一个不同的事件

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:41.310
and that's going to trigger the running of that code.
并且会触发那段代码的运行。

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:48.490
But notice too that this block is actually customizable--
但也要注意，这个积木实际上是可以自定义的——

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:51.010
I can change it, parameterize it slightly,
我可以对它做一些修改，对它进行参数化设置，

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:52.960
just by clicking on this arrow.
只要点击这个箭头就行。

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:55.420
And this opens up a menu where I can choose
这样就会弹出一个菜单，我可以从中选择

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.090
what key it's going to respond to-- it doesn't just
它要响应哪个键——它不只是

00:16:58.090 --> 00:17:01.130
have to be when the Space bar on my keyboard is pressed.
必须在我按下键盘上的空格键时才起作用。

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:05.410
I can have it respond to, let's say, the Right arrow or the Left arrow.
我可以让它响应，比如说，右箭头键或者左箭头键。

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:08.150
So I go to Right arrow, and instead of playing
所以我选择右箭头键，并且不播放

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:10.710
a sound, when you get the right arrow--
声音了，当你按下右箭头键时——

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:14.990
let's go ahead and change the x value by 10.
我们直接把x坐标值增加10。

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:18.020
Remember that each sprite exists in this xy
要记得每个角色都存在于这个x - y坐标体系中

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:21.710
coordinate grid on the stage, where x refers to how far to the left
舞台上的坐标网格，其中x表示某个角色向左

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:25.099
or to the right a particular sprite is-- and y refers to how
或向右移动的距离 —— 而y表示某个角色

00:17:25.099 --> 00:17:27.770
far up or down a particular sprite is.
向上或向下移动的距离。

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:32.540
And so now, the Right arrow key is going to move the fish to the right
现在，右方向键将使鱼向右移动

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:33.660
by 10 spaces.
10个单位。

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.670
So I'll press the Right arrow key and you'll
所以我按下右方向键，你会

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:37.670
see the fish move a little bit-- press it again,
看到鱼移动一点 —— 再按一次，

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:43.530
and it moves, and it keeps moving every time I press that key.
它会继续移动，每次我按下那个键它都会移动。

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:47.007
Let's now add the ability for this Right to respond to the Left arrow key.
现在让我们添加这个角色对左方向键做出响应的功能。

00:17:47.007 --> 00:17:48.840
And this is going to be very similar, I just
这会非常相似，我只是

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.520
want to move in the opposite direction--
想朝相反的方向移动 ——

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.800
I want to go left instead of going right.
我想向左而不是向右移动。

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:56.910
And I could drag the event out and then drag another change x by and change it
我可以把事件积木拖出来，然后再拖一个“将x坐标增加”积木，然后把它

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:59.117
to negative 10 instead of 10 this time.
这次改成 -10 而不是 10。

00:17:59.117 --> 00:18:01.950
But in this case, because it's very similar to the code I've already
但在这种情况下，因为它和我已经

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:06.330
written, I can actually Control-click or Right-click on this script
写好的代码非常相似，我实际上可以按住Control键点击或右键点击这个脚本

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.580
and just say Duplicate.
然后选择“复制”。

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:13.660
And when I Duplicate, I get a copy of what it is that I've just written
当我复制时，我得到了我刚刚写的代码的副本

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:14.730
and now I can modify it.
现在我可以修改它。

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:17.320
Instead of responding to the Right arrow,
不要对右方向键做出响应，

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.010
let's have this script respond to the Left arrow.
让这个脚本对左方向键做出响应。

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:24.300
And instead of changing x by 10, let's change x by negative 10
不要将x坐标增加 10，而是将x坐标增加 -10

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:27.660
to have the fish move in the negative direction instead.
让鱼朝相反方向移动。

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:30.870
And just for fun, let's go ahead and click on the stage
只是为了好玩，让我们点击舞台

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:34.590
and change the backdrop to underwater so that it actually feels like the fish is
把背景换成水下场景，这样就真的感觉鱼在

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.682
swimming around underwater.
水下游动了。

00:18:37.682 --> 00:18:39.640
And so now when I press the Right arrow, you'll
所以现在当我按下右方向键，你会

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:43.600
see the fish moving to the right, and when I press the Left arrow,
看到鱼向右移动，当我按下左方向键，

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:46.240
the fish is moving backwards?
鱼是在往后退吗？

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:49.750
That may not be exactly what I want, but it is moving to the left at least.
这可能不是我想要的效果，但至少它是在向左移动。

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.580
And I can make this a little better maybe
也许我可以让它变得更好一点

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.697
by allowing its rotation to change--
允许它的旋转方向改变 ——

00:18:53.697 --> 00:18:55.780
let it face the left when it's moving to the left,
当它向左移动时让它面朝左，

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.300
let it face the right when it's moving to the right.
当它向右移动时让它面朝右。

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:02.540
And remember I can do that just by using this Point In Direction block.
记得我可以通过使用“面向”积木来做到这一点。

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.020
So when the Right arrow is pressed, let's go ahead
所以当按下右方向键时，让我们

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:08.740
and Point In Direction 90 degrees, meaning facing the right,
面向 90 度方向，也就是朝右，

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:10.490
and move 10 steps.
然后移动 10 步。

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:14.923
And if the Left arrow key is pressed, let's Point In Direction negative 90.
如果按下左方向键，让我们面向 -90 度方向。

00:19:14.923 --> 00:19:16.840
And if you didn't remember what number it was,
如果你不记得是哪个数字了，

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:20.330
you could use this dial of course to change the value as well
当然，你也可以用这个转盘来改变数值

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:22.720
and then change x by negative 10.
然后将 x 坐标减去 10。

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:25.000
And this might be closer, let's try it out--
这可能更接近了，让我们试试看——

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:28.360
I press Right and the fish moves to the right.
我按右方向键，鱼就向右移动。

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:32.580
Now I press the Left arrow key and the fish turns upside down--
现在我按左方向键，鱼就倒过来了——

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.090
OK, not quite what I wanted.
好吧，这不是我想要的效果。

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:36.820
Again, by default-- when you rotate a sprite,
同样，默认情况下——当你旋转一个角色时，

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.540
it's just going to rotate in a circle--
它只会绕着一个圈旋转——

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.300
which means it might end up upside down.
这意味着它最终可能会倒过来。

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:43.480
If you just want it to be able to go back and forth between left and right,
如果你只想让它能在左右方向上来回移动，

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:48.190
be sure to go to Direction and change the fish's rotation style
一定要到“方向”那里去改变鱼的旋转方式

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:49.750
to left and right.
改为左右翻转。

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:53.950
And now, when it goes right, it faces the right, and when it goes left,
现在，当它向右移动时，它面朝右边；当它向左移动时，

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:56.120
it faces the left.
它面朝左边。

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:58.640
Notice too that, if you wanted to change this with code,
也要注意，如果想用代码来改变这个设置，

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:00.080
you also have this block here--
这里还有一个积木——

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:03.380
Set Rotation Style-- that will let you using a block of code
“设置旋转方式”——它能让你用一块代码积木

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:08.370
decide what rotation style that particular sprite should have.
来决定某个特定角色应该采用哪种旋转方式。

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:12.843
And so now I have the ability to let this fish move left and right--
所以现在我能让这条鱼左右移动了——

00:20:12.843 --> 00:20:14.010
and I could add to this too.
我还可以在此基础上进行扩展。

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:18.030
If I want to let it move up and down, then I'll add one more Event, and say--
如果我想让它能上下移动，那我就再添加一个事件，然后说——

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:21.570
not when the Space key is pressed, but when the Up arrow is pressed.
不是当按下空格键时，而是当按下上方向键时。

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.520
Let's go ahead and have it move--
我们接着让它移动——

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.470
we're not changing x anymore, we're instead
我们不再改变 x 坐标了，而是

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:31.020
changing y because y refers to the up and down direction of the sprite.
改变 y 坐标，因为 y 坐标代表角色的上下方向。

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:35.010
So when the Up arrow key is pressed, we're going to change y by 10,
所以当按下上方向键时，我们将 y 坐标增加 10，

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:37.620
and I'll duplicate this by going to the Event block
我要通过进入事件积木区

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:41.740
Control- or Right-clicking, clicking Duplicate.
按 Ctrl 键或右键点击，然后点击“复制”来复制这个积木。

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:48.310
And now, when the Down arrow is pressed, let's change y by negative 10.
现在，当按下下方向键时，我们将 y 坐标减去 10。

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:51.060
And so now I can get my fish to move to the right,
所以现在我能让我的鱼向右移动，

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:56.050
I can get my fish to move to the left, I can get it to move up or down as well.
能让我的鱼向左移动，也能让它上下移动。

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:58.560
And I can get it to move across the stage all just
而且我只要

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:00.930
by pressing keys on the keyboard.
通过按键盘上的键，就能让它在舞台上四处移动。

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:02.682
And using that ability, you could imagine
利用这种能力，你可以想象

00:21:02.682 --> 00:21:04.140
trying to create some sort of game.
尝试创建某种游戏。

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:06.600
Maybe you've played a game on a computer before where
也许你以前在电脑上玩过这样的游戏，在游戏里

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.790
you use the arrow keys or other keys on the keyboard
你用键盘上的方向键或其他键

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:10.590
to move some character around.
来移动某个角色。

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:14.190
Now we have that exact same ability within Scratch itself too.
现在在 Scratch 里我们也有了完全相同的能力。

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:17.350
By clicking and by pressing various different keys on the keyboard,
通过点击以及按下键盘上各种不同的键，

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:21.250
we can get our sprite to respond to that as well.
我们也能让角色对其做出响应。

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.400
And it's not just the Space and the arrow keys--
而且不只是空格键和方向键——

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:25.980
it's letters of the alphabet that you could have be pressed,
你还可以设置字母键被按下时的响应，

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:29.250
or numbers on the keypad for example that might be pressed.
比如小键盘上的数字键被按下时也能有响应。

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:31.460
And so let's give that a try too just for fun--
那我们也来试试，就当好玩——

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:33.270
I'll add a few more blocks here.
我在这里再添加几个积木。

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:35.730
Let's let the fish change in size--
让这条鱼可以改变大小——

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:39.330
maybe I want to be able to choose between how big or small the fish is
也许我想能选择这条鱼要变大还是变小。

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.600
going to be.
将会是。

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:44.610
And so when the 1 key is pressed--
当按下数字1键时——

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.200
let's make it small when you press 1.
按下1时让它变小。

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:53.150
So we'll go into Looks and let's set the size to maybe 50%.
我们到“外观”分类里，把大小设为50%吧。

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:55.940
And I'll duplicate this block again by clicking,
我再通过点击来复制这个积木，

00:21:55.940 --> 00:22:00.220
or Right-clicking or Control-clicking on the Event block, clicking Duplicate.
或者右键点击，或者按住Ctrl点击事件积木，然后点击“复制”。

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:04.870
Now when the 2 key is pressed, let's make it normal size 100,
现在，当按下数字2键时，让它恢复正常大小100，

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:06.670
and we'll duplicate one more time.
我们再复制一次。

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:09.310
Now, when the 3 key is pressed--
现在，当按下数字3键时——

00:22:09.310 --> 00:22:13.220
let's add the size to be bigger, we'll set it to be 200%.
让它变得更大，我们把大小设为200%。

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.230
And so now, watch what happens--
现在，看看会发生什么——

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:21.370
I can still move the fish around, it's still responding to the arrow keys,
我仍然可以移动这条鱼，它仍然会对方向键做出响应，

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:23.578
but now I can also use the numbers to control how
但现在我还可以用数字键来控制这条鱼的

00:22:23.578 --> 00:22:25.120
big or small the fish is going to be.
大小。

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:29.680
If I press 1, the fish shrinks-- it's now 50% of the usual size.
如果我按下1，鱼会变小——现在它是正常大小的50%。

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:32.680
When I press 2, it goes back to normal size--
当我按下2，它会恢复正常大小——

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:36.100
and when I press 3, the fish gets much larger--
当我按下3，鱼会变得大很多——

00:22:36.100 --> 00:22:39.790
it goes to 200% of its original size.
它会变成原来大小的200%。

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:43.210
And so by putting together these various different scripts, each of which
通过把这些不同的脚本组合在一起，每个脚本

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:45.980
is responding to a different key on the keyboard,
都对应键盘上不同的按键做出响应，

00:22:45.980 --> 00:22:49.630
you can allow the user to control your sprites in any number of ways.
你就能让用户以各种方式控制你的角色。

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:53.290
Allowing them to interact with the stage by telling them what to click on,
让他们通过点击、按键与舞台进行交互，

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:57.340
what to press, in order to see a particular response appear on the stage
从而在舞台上看到特定的响应。

00:22:57.340 --> 00:22:58.913
as well.
也一样。

00:22:58.913 --> 00:23:01.330
And so now we have the ability within our Scratch programs
现在，在我们的Scratch程序里，我们有能力

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:04.570
to respond to a number of Events that can respond to the flag Being Clicked,
对多种事件做出响应，比如点击绿旗，

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:09.460
to a click of something on the stage, also responding to a press of a key.
点击舞台上的某个东西，还有按下按键。

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:12.040
But there are a couple of other fun Events
但还有一些有趣的事件，

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:15.520
that we might let our sprites respond to, so let's try one of them now.
我们可以让角色对其做出响应，现在我们来试试其中一个。

00:23:15.520 --> 00:23:18.860
I'll go ahead and get rid of the fish, and let's
我先把鱼删掉，然后

00:23:18.860 --> 00:23:23.060
change the backdrop-- we'll go back to the plain white backdrop,
换个背景——我们换回纯白色背景，

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:25.178
and let's add a new sprite.
再添加一个新角色。

00:23:25.178 --> 00:23:28.220
And the sprite I want to add this time is the balloon-- we haven't really
这次我想添加的角色是气球——我们还没真正

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:29.380
played around with that.
用过这个角色呢。

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:33.300
I'll go ahead and center the balloon and I'll go into Events,
我先把气球放到舞台中央，然后我要进入“事件”模块，

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:36.720
and the Event I'm curious about now is this one here--
现在我感兴趣的事件是这个——

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.870
When Loudness Is Greater Than 10--
当音量大于 10 时——

00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:43.920
and loudness refers to input coming in from your computer's microphone.
这里的音量指的是从你电脑麦克风输入的声音。

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:45.930
So when you use this block for the first time,
所以当你第一次使用这个积木时，

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:47.820
your browser might ask you for permission
你的浏览器可能会请求你授权

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.778
to use your microphone because Scratch is going
使用你的麦克风，因为 Scratch 要

00:23:49.778 --> 00:23:51.760
to be listening to that microphone.
监听那个麦克风。

00:23:51.760 --> 00:23:54.990
And what it's going to be doing is calculating how loudly
它要做的是计算它听到声音的音量大小，

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:56.580
it hears something, for example--
比如说——

00:23:56.580 --> 00:23:59.010
it's all going to be on a 0 to 100 scale where
音量范围是 0 到 100，

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:03.240
0 is like complete silence and 100 is very, very loud.
0 表示完全安静，100 表示非常非常大声。

00:24:03.240 --> 00:24:09.000
And so if I set this to maybe 30 or so, then this code is going to respond,
所以如果我把这个值设为 30 左右，那么这段代码就会响应，

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:14.410
and it's going to run some code whenever the loudness gets above 30 for example.
例如，每当音量超过 30 时，它就会运行一些代码。

00:24:14.410 --> 00:24:18.480
And what I'm going to do is, when the loudness gets above 30,
我要做的是，当音量超过 30 时，

00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:22.380
let's go to Looks and change the size by 10.
我们去“外观”模块，将大小改变 10。

00:24:22.380 --> 00:24:25.077
We're going to increase the size of the balloon by 10--
我们要把气球的大小增加 10——

00:24:25.077 --> 00:24:28.410
and I haven't connected them yet because I don't want this code to start running
我还没把它们连接起来，因为我不想让这段代码现在就开始运行

00:24:28.410 --> 00:24:32.640
just yet-- but once I connect it, what's going to happen is that whenever
——但一旦我把它们连接起来，接下来会发生的是，每当

00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:35.235
Scratch detects that the loudness has gone above 30--
Scratch 检测到音量超过 30——

00:24:35.235 --> 00:24:37.860
and I might have to play around with that number a little bit--
我可能得稍微调整一下这个数值——

00:24:37.860 --> 00:24:40.653
then the size of the balloon is going to change by 10.
那么气球的大小就会改变 10。

00:24:40.653 --> 00:24:42.570
And so this lets me have a little bit of fun--
这样我就能玩得开心点了——

00:24:42.570 --> 00:24:44.820
I can try and blow up the balloon, for example.
比如，我可以试着把气球吹大。

00:24:44.820 --> 00:24:54.950
I'll connect these two blocks and every time I blow,
我把这两个积木连接起来，每次我吹气，

00:24:54.950 --> 00:24:57.860
that triggers the loudness threshold-- it goes above the 30--
就会触发音量阈值——音量超过 30——

00:24:57.860 --> 00:25:00.260
and I've disconnected it for now so that the balloon doesn't get bigger
我现在把它们断开了，这样在我说话的时候气球就不会越变越大

00:25:00.260 --> 00:25:01.885
and bigger while I'm talking right now.
了。

00:25:01.885 --> 00:25:04.850
But every time the loudness goes above a particular threshold,
但每次音量超过某个特定阈值时，

00:25:04.850 --> 00:25:07.130
well then the size of the balloon is going to change--
那么气球的大小就会改变——

00:25:07.130 --> 00:25:10.160
and you probably saw that balloon get a little bit bigger and bigger
你可能每次都看到气球变得越来越大了。

00:25:10.160 --> 00:25:10.730
every time.
每次。

00:25:10.730 --> 00:25:13.813
And you can have fun with this playing around with that threshold deciding
你可以通过调整这个阈值来玩得开心，决定

00:25:13.813 --> 00:25:17.000
how loud something needs to be, or how quiet something needs to be in order
声音要多大，或者多小才能得到特定的结果。

00:25:17.000 --> 00:25:19.680
to get a particular result to happen.
为了让特定结果出现。

00:25:19.680 --> 00:25:24.170
And so loudness is another type of Event that Scratch will let you respond to.
所以音量是 Scratch 允许你响应的另一种事件。

00:25:24.170 --> 00:25:27.980
And just for one final example, notice here too that this loudness is
再举最后一个例子，注意这里的音量是

00:25:27.980 --> 00:25:31.640
a dropdown menu-- in the same way that pressing a key on the keyboard had
一个下拉菜单——就像按下键盘上的某个键一样

00:25:31.640 --> 00:25:33.290
a dropdown menu where I could say--
一个下拉菜单，我可以在这里选择——

00:25:33.290 --> 00:25:35.480
I don't just want the Scratch project to respond
我不只想让Scratch项目在按下空格键时做出响应

00:25:35.480 --> 00:25:37.430
to when the space key is pressed, but I want
我还想让它在按下箭头键、字母键或数字键时做出响应。

00:25:37.430 --> 00:25:40.310
it to respond to an arrow key, or a letter, or a number.
它能响应箭头键、字母或者数字。

00:25:40.310 --> 00:25:42.620
I have another option here--
我这里还有另一个选项——

00:25:42.620 --> 00:25:45.440
I can choose when loudness is greater than 30,
我可以选择当音量大于30时

00:25:45.440 --> 00:25:48.590
or when Timer is greater than a particular number.
或者当计时器超过某个特定数字时。

00:25:48.590 --> 00:25:51.530
And so every Scratch project, though we haven't seen it just yet,
所以每个Scratch项目，虽然我们还没看到，

00:25:51.530 --> 00:25:54.410
has a built-in timer and the timer is keeping
都有一个内置的计时器，这个计时器会记录

00:25:54.410 --> 00:25:58.832
track of how much time has passed since we started the project.
从我们启动项目开始过去了多少时间。

00:25:58.832 --> 00:26:01.790
So when the project starts, we start counting how much time has passed,
所以当项目启动时，我们开始计算过去了多少时间，

00:26:01.790 --> 00:26:04.680
and that timer is keeping track of that for us.
那个计时器会帮我们记录这个时间。

00:26:04.680 --> 00:26:07.460
And so originally, if you think back to our first program
所以回想一下我们之前做的第一个程序，

00:26:07.460 --> 00:26:10.370
that we made earlier, where we had the cat and the dinosaur talking
当时猫和恐龙在互相交谈，

00:26:10.370 --> 00:26:13.190
to each other and they both said hello at the same time,
它们同时说了“你好”，

00:26:13.190 --> 00:26:15.450
why did they both say hello at the same time?
为什么它们会同时说“你好”呢？

00:26:15.450 --> 00:26:18.350
They both said hello at the same time because they
它们同时说“你好”是因为它们

00:26:18.350 --> 00:26:21.260
were both responding to the same event, the When Flag
都对同一个事件做出了响应，即“当旗帜被点击”

00:26:21.260 --> 00:26:23.000
Clicked Event that happened once.
这个只触发一次的事件。

00:26:23.000 --> 00:26:27.440
And as soon as I pressed the green flag, then both the cat and the dinosaur
我一按下绿色旗帜，猫和恐龙

00:26:27.440 --> 00:26:28.392
said hello.
就都说了“你好”。

00:26:28.392 --> 00:26:31.100
In an actual conversation, of course, they probably wouldn't both
在实际的对话中，当然，它们可能不会都

00:26:31.100 --> 00:26:32.570
say hello at the same time--
同时说“你好”——

00:26:32.570 --> 00:26:37.310
the cat might say hello and the dinosaur might respond a few seconds later.
猫可能会先说“你好”，恐龙可能会在几秒钟后回应。

00:26:37.310 --> 00:26:39.650
And we can take advantage now of this Timer--
现在我们可以利用这个计时器了——

00:26:39.650 --> 00:26:43.410
the ability to wait for the Timer to reach a particular number.
等待计时器达到某个特定数字的功能。

00:26:43.410 --> 00:26:46.820
And when the Timer reaches that number, then an Event
当计时器达到那个数字时，就会触发一个事件——

00:26:46.820 --> 00:26:51.660
is triggered-- that will let us time sprites a little bit more precisely.
这能让我们更精确地控制角色的时间。

00:26:51.660 --> 00:26:53.660
And so let's give that a try by going back
那我们来试试看，回到

00:26:53.660 --> 00:26:56.690
to the project we created at the beginning of today.
我们今天一开始创建的项目。

00:26:56.690 --> 00:27:02.420
I'll delete the balloon, go into my sprites, and let's add our cat back--
我会删除气球，进入我的角色列表，然后把猫再加回来——

00:27:02.420 --> 00:27:04.490
we'll bring our cat over to the left.
我们把猫移到左边。

00:27:04.490 --> 00:27:07.130
And I'll add one more sprite, I'll go ahead
我再添加一个角色，我接着

00:27:07.130 --> 00:27:10.070
and bring our dinosaur back as well--
也把恐龙加回来——

00:27:10.070 --> 00:27:13.022
that dinosaur is going to have a rotation style of left right
那只恐龙的旋转方式设为左右旋转

00:27:13.022 --> 00:27:15.230
because I only want it to face the left or the right.
因为我只想让它面向左边或右边。

00:27:15.230 --> 00:27:18.690
And I'll change the direction to negative 90
我把方向改成 -90 度

00:27:18.690 --> 00:27:22.240
so that the cat and the dinosaur are facing each other.
这样猫和恐龙就会面对面了。

00:27:22.240 --> 00:27:24.610
And for the cat, the code is going to be the same--
对于猫来说，代码还是一样的——

00:27:24.610 --> 00:27:29.410
we'll have the cat respond to an Event, the Event will be When Flag Is Clicked,
我们让猫对一个事件做出响应，这个事件就是“当旗帜被点击”

00:27:29.410 --> 00:27:33.870
I want the cat to say hello for two seconds.
我想让猫说两秒的“你好”。

00:27:33.870 --> 00:27:36.330
But I want the dinosaur not to immediately say hello
但我不想让恐龙在旗帜被点击后立刻说“你好”

00:27:36.330 --> 00:27:39.720
when the flag is clicked, but to wait for the cat-- let the cat say hello
而是等猫——让猫先说完“你好”

00:27:39.720 --> 00:27:42.420
and then the dinosaur can respond.
然后恐龙再回应。

00:27:42.420 --> 00:27:44.650
So under the dinosaur, instead of using the
所以在恐龙角色这里，我不使用

00:27:44.650 --> 00:27:48.150
When Flag Clicked Event which would happen right away,
旗帜被点击事件，因为这个事件会立刻触发，

00:27:48.150 --> 00:27:55.150
I'm instead going to use them When Timer Is Greater Than 2.
我要使用“当计时器的值大于2”事件。

00:27:55.150 --> 00:27:57.350
In other words, after the Timer reaches 2,
换句话说，当计时器达到2之后，

00:27:57.350 --> 00:28:00.910
in other words, after two seconds have passed in my project--
也就是在我的项目开始两秒之后——

00:28:00.910 --> 00:28:06.730
we'll then and only then should the dinosaur say hello for two seconds
只有到那时，恐龙才应该说两秒的“你好”

00:28:06.730 --> 00:28:07.827
as well.
也是两秒。

00:28:07.827 --> 00:28:09.160
And so now notice what happens--
现在注意看会发生什么——

00:28:09.160 --> 00:28:15.890
I'll press the green flag, the cat says "hello" for two seconds,
我点击绿色旗帜，猫会说两秒“你好”，

00:28:15.890 --> 00:28:20.248
and only once the cat is done the dinosaur then says "hello" as well.
只有等猫说完，恐龙才会接着说“你好”。

00:28:20.248 --> 00:28:22.040
And that's because the dinosaur is waiting,
这是因为恐龙在等待，

00:28:22.040 --> 00:28:25.370
it's not going right when the project starts, it's waiting for the Timer
项目开始时它不会马上行动，它在等计时器

00:28:25.370 --> 00:28:26.300
to reach 2.
达到2。

00:28:26.300 --> 00:28:30.530
And the Timer, again, begins every time we click on the green flag--
再说一次，每次我们点击绿色旗帜，计时器就会开始计时——

00:28:30.530 --> 00:28:33.200
but when the green flag is clicked, the Timer resets back to 0,
但当绿色旗帜被点击时，计时器会重置为0，

00:28:33.200 --> 00:28:36.770
and it's counting up in terms of how many seconds have passed
它会从项目开始起开始计算过去了多少秒

00:28:36.770 --> 00:28:39.530
since the beginning of the project.
从项目开始算起。

00:28:39.530 --> 00:28:42.773
And there are other events that we can use inside of Scratch as well that we
在Scratch里还有其他我们可以使用的事件，

00:28:42.773 --> 00:28:43.940
haven't yet taken a look at.
我们还没看过。

00:28:43.940 --> 00:28:47.450
There's one here, for example, that checks when the backdrop switches
比如这里有一个事件，它能检测背景何时切换

00:28:47.450 --> 00:28:48.800
to a particular backdrop.
到特定的背景。

00:28:48.800 --> 00:28:52.010
So recall before we had those various different backdrops with the Arctic,
还记得之前我们有北极、

00:28:52.010 --> 00:28:53.540
and the jungle, and underwater?
丛林和水下等不同的背景吗？

00:28:53.540 --> 00:28:57.770
You could add Events that say, as soon as the backdrop switches to underwater,
你可以添加事件，比如当背景切换到水下时，

00:28:57.770 --> 00:29:00.480
then play those bubbles or the ocean sounds for example,
就播放泡泡声或者海洋音效，

00:29:00.480 --> 00:29:02.810
or do some other action depending on what
或者根据切换到的

00:29:02.810 --> 00:29:04.520
backdrop happens to be switched to.
背景执行其他操作。

00:29:04.520 --> 00:29:07.670
But you can hopefully now start to see how these events really
希望你现在能开始明白这些事件是如何

00:29:07.670 --> 00:29:10.970
start to make our Scratch projects more powerful and more interactive.
让我们的Scratch项目变得更强大、更具交互性的。

00:29:10.970 --> 00:29:14.990
We no longer need to say, run this block of code now, run that block of code
我们不再需要说“现在运行这段代码，现在运行那段代码”

00:29:14.990 --> 00:29:15.500
now--
现在——

00:29:15.500 --> 00:29:18.590
we can add Events to our project and let our project
我们可以在项目中添加事件，让项目

00:29:18.590 --> 00:29:20.300
decide when to run that code.
自己决定何时运行代码。

00:29:20.300 --> 00:29:24.320
Letting it respond to when the project begins, or when we click on something,
让项目对项目开始、点击某个东西

00:29:24.320 --> 00:29:27.830
or when we press a key on the keyboard, or when the loudness changes,
按下键盘上的某个键、音量变化等情况做出响应，

00:29:27.830 --> 00:29:30.050
or any number of other different types of events
或者对其他各种不同类型的事件做出响应

00:29:30.050 --> 00:29:32.630
that Scratch now gives us the ability to use.
现在Scratch让我们具备了使用的能力。

00:29:32.630 --> 00:29:36.230
And hopefully now using Events, we'll be able to create all the more interesting
希望现在通过使用事件，我们能够创造出更有趣的

00:29:36.230 --> 00:29:38.297
and interactive projects as well.
以及交互式的项目。

00:29:38.297 --> 00:29:41.130
That's it for An Introduction to Programming with Scratch for today.
今天的《用Scratch学编程入门》就讲到这里。

00:29:41.130 --> 00:29:44.210
Next time, we'll take these ideas and build up on them even more,
下次，我们会基于这些想法进一步拓展，

00:29:44.210 --> 00:29:46.000
see you then.
到时候见。
